## Matrix & enforcement principles

- Strict **RBAC + ABAC**: no UI, API, menu, component, action, or workflow may be visible or usable without effective permission.
- Module/action access always intersects with assigned modules **and** subscription ([subscriptions.mdc](./subscriptions.mdc)).
- Permission config is source-controlled, versioned, and fully auditable.
- Authorized admins may adjust or restore defaults at any time; every change and restore is atomic and must not leave partial or excess access.
- Failed permission changes roll back completely, and audit history must identify actor, before/after state, reason, and version.
- Frontend mirrors backend authorization via guards; backend remains mandatory.

